			(property "Description" "LSM9DS1 3D accelerometer, gyroscope & magnetometer\n\nThe LSM9DS1 is a system-in-package featuring a 3D digital linear acceleration sensor, a 3D digital angular rate sensor, and a 3D digital magnetic sensor.\n\nThe LSM9DS1 has a linear acceleration full scale of ±2g/±4g/±8/±16 g, a magnetic field full scale of ±4/±8/±12/±16 gauss and an angular rate of ±245/±500/±2000 dps.\n\nThe LSM9DS1 includes an I2 C serial bus interface supporting standard and fast mode (100 kHz and 400 kHz) and an SPI serial standard interface.\n\nMagnetic, accelerometer and gyroscope sensing can be enabled or set in power-down mode separately for smart power management.\n\nThe LSM9DS1 is available in a plastic land grid array package (LGA) and it is guaranteed to operate over an extended temperature range from -40 °C to +85 °C."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
				)
			)
